learning applications that

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:02.750
entail building, training,
and deploying your own custom

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.730
machine learning models.

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.470
We're also very
fortunate to have

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:09.410
Andreas Rodriguez
