00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.260
And after that, I will
hand it over to Andreas

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:59.250
to talk about how Intel has
leveraged Kubeflow Pipelines

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:04.320
